msgid "A GitHub branch rule rejected direct publication. Review the repository rules."
msgstr "GitHub 브랜치 규칙이 직접 발행을 거부했습니다. 저장소 규칙을 확인하세요."

msgid "A GitHub token is already registered. Reload this page to manage it."
